            When de-linking a sub-loan:
            The request will fail if you try to remove the account that is listed as the Swap LOC Account number.
            The Account Sequence and the Excess Payment Sequence will be assigned and updated according to the standard DNA standard functionality.
            &lt;/summary></xs:documentation>
